{"availability":"available","full":"durgeshkhushlani/HireSphere","name":"HireSphere","description":" Campus placement management platform replacing spreadsheets and email chains. Next.js/TypeScript + Node/Express + PostgreSQL/Prisma. Admins run drives with eligibility rules and custom forms; students apply, track status, and manage resumes. Includes a scoped company portal, auto-close scheduling, email notifications, Excel export, and a demo mode","category":"Business","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-10T10:51:13Z","updated":"2026-08-10T05:04:45Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hiresphere-university.vercel.app/","topics":["campus-recruitment","groq-integration","nextjs","nodejs","placement-management-system","placement-portal","postgresql","typescript"],"demo":"https://hiresphere-university.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.532Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.532Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.532Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.532Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A campus placement management platform — replacing spreadsheets and email chains with a centralized system for placement admins to run company drives and for students to apply.","Status: v2 rebuild in progress. The original MERN prototype has been retired and archived under legacy/; this repo now tracks a ground-up rebuild on a new stack.","The v1 prototype validated the core idea (admin-run drives, student applications, resume uploads) but was built fast as a first pass. v2 redesigns the data model and backend from scratch with a proper relational schema, cleaner separation of concerns, and a monorepo layout that scales past a single app."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/durgeshkhushlani/HireSphere/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a20aebd86df93ca0ed466f47100c2281d064d002026c687bbdab28453742aa49","